WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.516
Does your computer keep overheating, freezing,
or taking forever to boot up?

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:11.440
Meet Nyctale: a clean diagnostic tool with zero ads
and zero scareware tactics.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.904
With a single click, it checks 11 vital system areas in under 15 seconds.
Best of all: nothing ever leaves your PC.

4
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.236
The verdict is plain and simple: no cryptic error codes,
you know exactly what is going on.

5
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:38.284
At a glance, you can see the health of your disk space,
system memory, and startup apps.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.432
And if your PC gets hot, Nyctale checks real thermal throttling
and crash history instead of fake warnings.

7
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.040
Ready to fix it? One click is all it takes to take action.

8
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:04.272
It pinpoints large forgotten files.
Everything goes safely to the Recycle Bin, with zero risk.

9
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.876
Result: over 18 gigabytes freed up in seconds,
and your problem is solved!

10
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.256
Diagnosis is 100% free with no limits.
Visit nyctale.fr or get it on the Microsoft Store today.

